5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I worry the floor will buckle under the weight of our ambition.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The record shows we often forget what actually drew people back.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,Who is left to do the work? The staff list is a ghost.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I want to know where past seasons actually broke, not where they planned to.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The invoices always land after the season ends. I need to see the leaks.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Kenji, if the delivery slips, the whole room feels unstable.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, the ghost staff is a real danger. We must verify the hands.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, exactly. I need to know who is actually standing in the room.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, the leaks are real. I’ll check where the paperwork failed.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, agreed. I’ll trace the money that vanished into the walls.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will look at the structural survey and the evening hire bookings.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will review the visitor comment slips and the weekend head counts.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will check the conservation lab staffing and the volunteer roster.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will examine the lender paperwork and the loan transport costs.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will investigate the mount-making charges and the maintenance log.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,The building must survive the art. I will check the bay limits.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,The past is the only honest witness. I will read the slips.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I need to know who is carrying two roles. I will check the roster.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I want to see where the ships got stuck. I will check the cut-offs.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I will see where the money went. I will check the joiner's rate.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
