35,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The bay is capped at four hundred kilos. The last stonework needed shoring.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The slips say people came back because someone was present, not for the objects.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,The lab is down to one person. Two hundred pieces are waiting.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,Two openings slipped because the paperwork arrived after the shipping cut-off.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The joiner's rate has doubled. Bespoke mounts are eating the budget.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Kenji, if the paperwork slips, the delivery is late. The floor waits.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, if the lab is empty, the objects arrive dirty. The show fails.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, I agree. We cannot clean two hundred pieces in a season.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, the transport costs are high, but the delays are worse.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, the delays are symptoms. The costs are the disease.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Rin, the conservation backlog is a trap. We need a show that doesn't need cleaning.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, the comment slips prove presence matters. We need live demonstrations.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, I agree. But who will do the demonstrations? The volunteers are busy.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, the volunteers are the town history circle. They are already stretched.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, the town history circle is the only stable group. We must rely on them.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Benjamin, relying on them is risky. The structural limits are hard.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, the limits are real. But the presence is what brings them back.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, I agree. We need a show that uses the people we have.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, a local show avoids the shipping delays. It is safer.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, a local show avoids the mount-making costs. It is cheaper.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
